      "writtenOn": "2019-02-04T12:21:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t quite follow this sentence the first time I read it. Maybe preface with something like like: \"This form is used in parts of the REST API where an unambiguous identifier is required. In those cases, verifier cannot be use since ...\"",
      "revId": "f3551f2bbb2422ac4b51f728fdbf39b1f195af45",
