      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-05T14:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the create REST endpoint was changed, the verifier UUID is now the only supported identifier for all verifier REST endpoints, hence the sentence you propose does no longer match. I rephrased the current sentence a bit to make the intend clearer.\n\nDone.",
