      "writtenOn": "2019-02-05T14:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are no restrictions on the name. \nI\u0027ve change the create REST endpoint so that verifier-name can no longer appear in URLs, hence this section is removed.\n\nDone",
