      "writtenOn": "2019-02-04T12:21:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Might be worth having a check that this is a valid SHA-1. We really want to avoid storing something with the wrong format if we need to convert to notes later, and this is about the lowest level possible in the code.",
      "revId": "f3551f2bbb2422ac4b51f728fdbf39b1f195af45",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153",
