      },
      "lineNbr": 155,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-04T13:29:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not 100% sure either, I think it\u0027s to emphasize that you can call this method only after the load method was executed.\n\nThis name is consistent with \"getLoadedGroup\" in GroupConfig. If we change it here, we should also change it there. I will ask Alice for her opinion since she came up with this name prefix originally.",
      "parentUuid": "89145e4d_15058b49",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 155,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 155,
